(7226735, 1115610, 86218, '<td valign="top">A beautiful setting, mood and feeling of depth created with the wide angle. Would also love to see this in colour. The tar road does not gel entirely with the setting and would have pushed this a notch up on a gravel road or even just horses in the bush/velt, Yet it remains a shot with impact</td>', 'A beautiful setting, mood and feeling of depth created with the wide angle. Would also love to see this in colour. The tar road does not gel entirely with the setting and would have pushed this a notch up on a gravel road or even just horses in the bush/velt, Yet it remains a shot with impact', '2014-06-11 03:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
