(7226934, 1117114, 174999, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of this kind of photography, but I did love the CATS theater play..<br/> <br/>The shadows and light have really caught my attention and usually its the poses that I don''t care for.. this one is very, very elegant, smooth and relaxing. Not only her pose but the way her dancing outfit is really flowing and just fits very well into the picture and its not wrapped around her like you see a lot of times. To me this deserves a 10</td>', 'I am not a fan of this kind of photography, but I did love the CATS theater play.. The shadows and light have really caught my attention and usually its the poses that I don''t care for.. this one is very, very elegant, smooth and relaxing. Not only her pose but the way her dancing outfit is really flowing and just fits very well into the picture and its not wrapped around her like you see a lot of times. To me this deserves a 10', '2014-06-11 10:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
