(7227404, 1116933, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to bump up and to comment.<br/> <br/>Now this is one *fantastic* close-up of this big cat (Leopard?). Great light, beautiful details from the eyes to the fur to whiskers, and close up pose that makes me feel like I am right there almost nose to nose with this dangerous beauty.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to bump up and to comment. Now this is one *fantastic* close-up of this big cat (Leopard?). Great light, beautiful details from the eyes to the fur to whiskers, and close up pose that makes me feel like I am right there almost nose to nose with this dangerous beauty.', '2014-06-11 20:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7227405, 1115885, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great soft lighting here that projects the mood and compliments the shot making it feel like this is a fond memory. Pose of the model makes the audience think of who she might be waiting for and what the destination might be. Nicely done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great soft lighting here that projects the mood and compliments the shot making it feel like this is a fond memory. Pose of the model makes the audience think of who she might be waiting for and what the destination might be. Nicely done.', '2014-06-11 20:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
