(7227408, 1115609, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>You captured some wonderful details in the center ''stem'' of this flower then the thistle ''petals'' explode in the backdrop for a burst of pink fireworks. Lovely colors in this floral capture and the simple title mimics the visual of the photo quite nicely.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. You captured some wonderful details in the center ''stem'' of this flower then the thistle ''petals'' explode in the backdrop for a burst of pink fireworks. Lovely colors in this floral capture and the simple title mimics the visual of the photo quite nicely.', '2014-06-11 20:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7227411, 1116831, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What wonderful light you have captured here! Love the golden shafts of light seen between the shadows of the tree  on the wet sand. Great composition of the elements for the clouds seem to adorn the bare branches acting like the foliage when it is spring. The sun itself seems caught in the tangle of branches.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What wonderful light you have captured here! Love the golden shafts of light seen between the shadows of the tree  on the wet sand. Great composition of the elements for the clouds seem to adorn the bare branches acting like the foliage when it is spring. The sun itself seems caught in the tangle of branches.', '2014-06-11 20:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
