(7227536, 1115836, 163430, '<td valign="top">A more pleasing crop (to me) on this one would be if the horizon was a little lower and the rocks ending in the very corner (lower left) of the frame.</td>', 'A more pleasing crop (to me) on this one would be if the horizon was a little lower and the rocks ending in the very corner (lower left) of the frame.', '2014-06-12 03:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7227537, 1115723, 163430, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether i like or dislike the blown highlights in the top half of the background. Either way the image invokes strong emotions in me. I also like how the pink clothes make her stand out. If only she was looking the other way it would have been perfect. <br/>Have you tried selective desaturation? I would have :-)</td>', 'I don''t know whether i like or dislike the blown highlights in the top half of the background. Either way the image invokes strong emotions in me. I also like how the pink clothes make her stand out. If only she was looking the other way it would have been perfect. Have you tried selective desaturation? I would have :-)', '2014-06-12 03:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
