(7227552, 1115767, 163430, '<td valign="top">This one has potential that could have been exploited in postprocessing. A bit more sharpness or clarity, or maybe saturate the colors a bit or some vibrance, maybe even contrasty structured B&amp;W... I think there is a better image in this shot, it just needs to be discovered.</td>', 'This one has potential that could have been exploited in postprocessing. A bit more sharpness or clarity, or maybe saturate the colors a bit or some vibrance, maybe even contrasty structured B&W... I think there is a better image in this shot, it just needs to be discovered.', '2014-06-12 04:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
