(7227828, 1116064, 135744, '<td valign="top">Love the sea and clounds but not sure the boat and stand on the left add to it. Looks like a wonderful locatio. I would love to have a go in that boat.</td>', 'Love the sea and clounds but not sure the boat and stand on the left add to it. Looks like a wonderful locatio. I would love to have a go in that boat.', '2014-06-12 12:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7227829, 1116635, 135744, '<td valign="top">Peekaboo to you too. A fun image with a lovely background colour. Composition is spot on - looks like perhaps the wee creature could have been in focus a bit more but I appreciate with macro shots like this it is not an easy task. You have done well!</td>', 'Peekaboo to you too. A fun image with a lovely background colour. Composition is spot on - looks like perhaps the wee creature could have been in focus a bit more but I appreciate with macro shots like this it is not an easy task. You have done well!', '2014-06-12 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7227830, 1116848, 135744, '<td valign="top">Wow I love the stepping out of the frame effect. I am not so sure it is legal so hope this doesn''t back fire on you. The photo is so clear and sharp - you must have been close enough to become his dinner.</td>', 'Wow I love the stepping out of the frame effect. I am not so sure it is legal so hope this doesn''t back fire on you. The photo is so clear and sharp - you must have been close enough to become his dinner.', '2014-06-12 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
