(7228469, 1116635, 117047, '<td valign="top">What a quirky little guy! Luv it!</td>', 'What a quirky little guy! Luv it!', '2014-06-13 14:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228529, 1116831, 23484, '<td valign="top">Seems like such an odd place for a tree but it''s an amazing image.</td>', 'Seems like such an odd place for a tree but it''s an amazing image.', '2014-06-13 18:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228530, 1115610, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love this in b&amp;w. Great contrast.</td>', 'I love this in b&w. Great contrast.', '2014-06-13 18:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228531, 1116660, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love what those long exposures do to the sky.</td>', 'I love what those long exposures do to the sky.', '2014-06-13 18:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228532, 1116778, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Excellent job.</td>', 'This is beautiful. Excellent job.', '2014-06-13 18:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228534, 1116300, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love this. Rough time ahead.</td>', 'I love this. Rough time ahead.', '2014-06-13 18:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228535, 1116881, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is such an interesting image.</td>', 'This is such an interesting image.', '2014-06-13 18:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228536, 1115609, 23484, '<td valign="top">Like an explosion.</td>', 'Like an explosion.', '2014-06-13 18:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228537, 1116922, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding and the title is perfect.</td>', 'This is outstanding and the title is perfect.', '2014-06-13 18:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228538, 1116333, 147314, '<td valign="top">Very familiar place, this is exactly the place where I lost my polarisation filter last month :-)<br/>But great image, good POV and great atmosphere..</td>', 'Very familiar place, this is exactly the place where I lost my polarisation filter last month :-)But great image, good POV and great atmosphere..', '2014-06-13 18:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228539, 1116823, 58634, '<td valign="top">This picture certainly tells a story. His expression makes the image.</td>', 'This picture certainly tells a story. His expression makes the image.', '2014-06-13 19:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228540, 1117111, 58634, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Lovely tones throughout. I am also envious of such a peaceful place to nap.</td>', 'Great perspective. Lovely tones throughout. I am also envious of such a peaceful place to nap.', '2014-06-13 19:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228541, 1115972, 58634, '<td valign="top">Although I find the colors a little too intense, I do like the fact that this has strong contrast especially because it makes all of the different colors of the bird stand out (black, blue, purple..). <br/> <br/>However, I  am not a fan of the border.</td>', 'Although I find the colors a little too intense, I do like the fact that this has strong contrast especially because it makes all of the different colors of the bird stand out (black, blue, purple..).  However, I  am not a fan of the border.', '2014-06-13 19:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228542, 1116348, 58634, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of lighting, very different from what one would expect of an image like this.</td>', 'Interesting choice of lighting, very different from what one would expect of an image like this.', '2014-06-13 19:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228543, 1117131, 58634, '<td valign="top">Grainy and eclectic. Looks peaceful yet tormentous at the same time. Wonderful job.</td>', 'Grainy and eclectic. Looks peaceful yet tormentous at the same time. Wonderful job.', '2014-06-13 19:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228544, 1116447, 58634, '<td valign="top">what a sweet creature. Lovely lighting to make those pretty brown colors stand out in a delicate way.</td>', 'what a sweet creature. Lovely lighting to make those pretty brown colors stand out in a delicate way.', '2014-06-13 19:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228545, 1117073, 58634, '<td valign="top">So beautiful and well done that it looks as if this was engraved in silver.</td>', 'So beautiful and well done that it looks as if this was engraved in silver.', '2014-06-13 19:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228546, 1117054, 58634, '<td valign="top">Excellent  focus on the bird.<br/>I like the way the colors in the background (especially the teal) really go well with the bird itself.</td>', 'Excellent  focus on the bird.I like the way the colors in the background (especially the teal) really go well with the bird itself.', '2014-06-13 19:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228547, 1117108, 58634, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if the blur in the middle of the flower was intentional or not.  It doesn''t seem that way, but if it is, I would''ve preferred for the petals themselves to be slightly more in focus here so that it doesn''t blend so much with the background bokeh.</td>', 'I am not sure if the blur in the middle of the flower was intentional or not.  It doesn''t seem that way, but if it is, I would''ve preferred for the petals themselves to be slightly more in focus here so that it doesn''t blend so much with the background bokeh.', '2014-06-13 19:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228549, 1116873, 58634, '<td valign="top">A beautiful mess.</td>', 'A beautiful mess.', '2014-06-13 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228563, 1116020, 58634, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this image, I thought to myself "What is it that was found?" and a few minutes later, I realized that there was a dragonfly in the picture! I love the way the red color stads out (albeit not at first glance, apparently!) LOL</td>', 'When I first saw this image, I thought to myself "What is it that was found?" and a few minutes later, I realized that there was a dragonfly in the picture! I love the way the red color stads out (albeit not at first glance, apparently!) LOL', '2014-06-13 20:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228564, 1116803, 58634, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous portrait of a cat. From the way the light hugs his face, to the way his eyes stand out, to the softness of the background and the roughness of the basket.</td>', 'Gorgeous portrait of a cat. From the way the light hugs his face, to the way his eyes stand out, to the softness of the background and the roughness of the basket.', '2014-06-13 20:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228565, 1117094, 58634, '<td valign="top">The rays of light look beautiful.</td>', 'The rays of light look beautiful.', '2014-06-13 20:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228566, 1116881, 58634, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures.</td>', 'Lovely textures.', '2014-06-13 20:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228567, 1116893, 58634, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous in every way.</td>', 'Gorgeous in every way.', '2014-06-13 20:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228568, 1116459, 58634, '<td valign="top">Oh my! He looks so angry! But my, what a great headshot!</td>', 'Oh my! He looks so angry! But my, what a great headshot!', '2014-06-13 20:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228569, 1117060, 58634, '<td valign="top">This is where I want to be RIGHT now!</td>', 'This is where I want to be RIGHT now!', '2014-06-13 20:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228570, 1116933, 58634, '<td valign="top">The tight crop works well here. I enjoy the intensity in here.</td>', 'The tight crop works well here. I enjoy the intensity in here.', '2014-06-13 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228572, 1115902, 58634, '<td valign="top">I do believe the moment captured here is unique. One of innocence and yet somehow full of fear.</td>', 'I do believe the moment captured here is unique. One of innocence and yet somehow full of fear.', '2014-06-13 20:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
