(7229477, 1116948, 58634, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the dark/light aspect of this. The silhouettes give this a very mysterious feeling yet the bright areas shine with hope.</td>', 'I really enjoy the dark/light aspect of this. The silhouettes give this a very mysterious feeling yet the bright areas shine with hope.', '2014-06-16 18:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
