(7229484, 1116286, 58634, '<td valign="top">Entrancing and inspiring. Everything here is fantastic.. The graininess adds so much character to this and the lights are strong and blown-out in all the right places to really make you contemplate.</td>', 'Entrancing and inspiring. Everything here is fantastic.. The graininess adds so much character to this and the lights are strong and blown-out in all the right places to really make you contemplate.', '2014-06-16 18:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
