(7229954, 1116626, 58634, '<td valign="top">Great reflection. However, I do find myself wishing the image was larger and that the sky wasn''t so blown out. It also seems a bit tilted.</td>', 'Great reflection. However, I do find myself wishing the image was larger and that the sky wasn''t so blown out. It also seems a bit tilted.', '2014-06-17 17:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
