(7230531, 1116976, 113900, '<td valign="top">This is so crazy good.    I could see this in a National Geographic magazine.   In fact I recommend you go on National Geogralhic''s website and submit this photo.   It really is brilliant and reminiscent of old school film photojournalism.  Well done, should have placed higher.    One of the best documentary/photojournalism type shots I''ve ever seen on this site.</td>', 'This is so crazy good.    I could see this in a National Geographic magazine.   In fact I recommend you go on National Geogralhic''s website and submit this photo.   It really is brilliant and reminiscent of old school film photojournalism.  Well done, should have placed higher.    One of the best documentary/photojournalism type shots I''ve ever seen on this site.', '2014-06-18 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7230534, 1117114, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yakatme:</b></div><hr/><i> Awesome!  I love the reflection.  What is the type of flooring that you used? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Robert, it''s a reflective vinyl flooring.</td>', 'Originally posted by yakatme: Awesome!  I love the reflection.  What is the type of flooring that you used?   Hi Robert, it''s a reflective vinyl flooring.', '2014-06-18 12:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
